00:04:47,368 --> 00:04:53,368
He made her his star. And his darkest obsession.

2
00:09:34,736 --> 00:09:40,736
The Girl is a drama, tv movie film directed by Julian Jarrold.

3
00:14:22,105 --> 00:14:28,105
Director Alfred Hitchcock is revered as one of the greatest
creative minds in the history of cinema.

4
00:19:09,473 --> 00:19:15,473
Known for his psychological thrillers, Hitchcock’s leading
ladies were cool, beautiful and preferably blonde.

5
00:23:56,842 --> 00:24:02,842
One such actress was Tippi Hedren, an unknown fashion model given her big
break when Hitchcock’s wife saw her on a TV commercial.

6
00:28:44,210 --> 00:28:50,210
Brought to Universal Studios, Hedren was shocked when the director, at the peak of his
career, quickly cast her to star in his next feature, 1963’s The Birds.

7
00:33:31,578 --> 00:33:37,578
Little did Hedren know that as ambitious and terrifying as the production would be to shoot,
the most daunting aspect of the film ended up coming from behind the camera.

8
00:38:18,947 --> 00:38:24,947
Tippi Hedren, played by Sienna Miller.

9
00:43:06,315 --> 00:43:12,315
Alfred Hitchcock, played by Toby Jones.

10
00:47:53,684 --> 00:47:59,684
Alma Reville Hitchcock, played by Imelda Staunton.

11
00:52:41,052 --> 00:52:47,052
Evan Hunter, played by Conrad Kemp.

12
00:57:28,421 --> 00:57:34,421
Peggy Robertson, played by Penelope Wilton.

13
01:02:15,789 --> 01:02:21,789
Melanie, played by Angelina Ingpen.

14
01:07:03,157 --> 01:07:09,157
Call Girl is a 2012 political thriller film directed by Mikael Marcimain
and written by Marietta von Hausswolff von Baumgarten.

15
01:11:50,526 --> 01:11:56,526
It stars Sofia Karemyr, Simon J.

16
01:16:37,894 --> 01:16:43,894
Berger and Josefin Asplund.

17
01:21:25,263 --> 01:21:31,263
The story is a fictionalised version of events based on the so-called Bordellhärvan political scandal of 1970s
Sweden which linked several prominent politicians to a prostitution ring that included underage girls.

18
01:26:12,631 --> 01:26:18,631
The tone is emotional and mind_bending.
